{"title":"천성의 약함","artist":"164","sourceId":"reference:tuGH4GOVQbe4d7Mdv7kf","sourceHash":"520eadc30fce2a0aef34bd91a4d1921756db1bf72b054093becbcf62be85dabd","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":35155323,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.87,"end":5.82,"text":"僕がずっと前から思ってる事を話そうか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":5.82,"end":10.86,"text":"友達に戻れたらこれ以上はもう望まないさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":10.86,"end":15.5,"text":"君がそれでいいなら僕だってそれで構わないさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":15.5,"end":21.52,"text":"嘘つきの僕が吐いた はんたいことばの愛のうた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":39.47,"end":44.33,"text":"今日はこっちの地方はどしゃぶりの晴天でした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":44.33,"end":49.06,"text":"昨日もずっと暇で一日満喫してました","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":49.06,"end":53.76,"text":"別に君のことなんて考えてなんかいないさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":53.76,"end":58.41,"text":"いやでもちょっと本当は考えてたかもなんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":58.41,"end":61.89,"text":"メリーゴーランドみたいに回る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":61.89,"end":65.93,"text":"僕の頭ん中はもうグルグルさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":65.93,"end":70.82,"text":"この両手から零れそうなほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":70.82,"end":75.37,"text":"君に貰った愛はどこに捨てよう?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":75.37,"end":82.62,"text":"限りのある消耗品なんて僕は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":82.62,"end":85.33,"text":"要らないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":85.33,"end":90.03999999999999,"text":"僕がずっと前から思ってる事を話そうか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":90.03999999999999,"end":94.63,"text":"姿は見えないのに言葉だけ見えちゃってるんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":94.63,"end":99.49000000000001,"text":"僕が知らないことがあるだけで気が狂いそうだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":99.49000000000001,"end":104.28999999999999,"text":"ぶら下がった感情が 綺麗なのか汚いのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":104.28999999999999,"end":113.99000000000001,"text":"僕にはまだわからず捨てる宛てもないんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":113.99000000000001,"end":118.75999999999999,"text":"言葉の裏の裏が見えるまで待つからさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":118.75999999999999,"end":122.26,"text":"待つくらいならいいじゃないか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":122.26,"end":127.93,"text":"進む君と止まった僕の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":127.93,"end":132.45,"text":"縮まらない隙を何で埋めよう？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":132.45,"end":139.74,"text":"まだ素直に言葉に出来ない僕は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":139.74,"end":142.12,"text":"天性の弱虫さ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":142.12,"end":146.97,"text":"この両手から零れそうなほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":146.97,"end":151.57999999999998,"text":"君に渡す愛を誰に譲ろう？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":151.57999999999998,"end":158.7,"text":"そんなんどこにも宛てがあるわけないだろ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":158.7,"end":165.04,"text":"まだ待つよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":165.04,"end":167.9,"text":"もういいかい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}